DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261016T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261016T213000
SUMMARY:Rage On - North Jersey
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis & More\nTime to let
  out some anger. We're heading to a rage room!!!!!\n\nThe event comes to y
 ou courtesy of our WhatsApp group chat and Angela\, one of our group regul
 ars.\n\nJoin us at 7:30 p.m. on Friday\, Oct. 16 at Smash House\, 701 Broa
 dway in Westwood.\n\nThis event will require some planning and pre-payment
  because a reservation looks to be required. I'll keep everyone posted and
  will confirm the details as we get closer to the date. After skimming the
  website\, the cost looks like it'll be between $30 and $70 per person.\n\
 nHere is the website: www.smashhousewestwood.com\n\n\\*\\*\\*There is a go
 od chance we'll hang out some more at a diner or bar afterward. The Ridge 
 Diner is nearby and open late\, but feel free to make suggestions!! \\*\\*
 \\*\n\nPAYMENT INFO: I've got Venmo\, Zelle\, PayPal and Cash App. Try to 
 locate my account with my email first. [andymilone@verizon.net](mailto:and
 ymilone@verizon.net) Or it may show up under my name Andy Milone or Andrew
  Milone. Or try 201-406-7222. You can try my other number\, 201-234-9609\,
  BUT PLEASE DON'T USE IT FOR VENMO! That is no longer my account. Thank yo
 u everyone!!! Feel free to reach out with any questions!!\n\nQuestions or 
 comments? You can message Andy on Meetup\, or call/text him at 201-234-960
 9.\n\nThis is our first rage room trip. Feel free to also check out bowlin
 g\, soccer\, volleyball\, tennis or one of our other activities at: www.me
 etup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleyball.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/316449345/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260906T215303Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260906T215303Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
