BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: NJ Bowling, Volleyball, Tennis & More
UID:event_316606290@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261003T050246Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261017T153000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261017T183000
SUMMARY:CASUAL Volleyball - North Jersey
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis & More\nWe're a gro
 up of people who will start by hitting the ball around for the first 20-30
  minutes and then will break up into 2-4 teams for two or three hours of C
 ASUAL play.\n\nIf we have more than 20 people show up\, we'll break up int
 o three or four teams of 6 (Some may have 7\, 8 or 9. Additional players j
 ust rotate into play). Games will be to 15 points. Rally scoring. Winner s
 tays on (unless a team has won four straight).\n\nWe'll be heading outdoor
 s to the hard court in Leonia off Overpeck County Pk Driveway in the Overp
 eck County Park.\n\n\\*\\*\\*After playing\, we'll likely head to Tropical
  Juice Bar\, an idea of regular attendee Kate\, for a drink and snack. The
  juice and smoothie bar is located at 60 River St. in Hackensack. Feel fre
 e to join us or suggest another spot for a post-volleyball hangout. \\*\\*
 \\*\n\nThere's no fee to play volleyball and nothing else you need to do b
 esides show up. Come anytime!! All are welcome!!!\n\nThis is a CASUAL play
 . We're not in a league and are not here to analyze your form. Most of us 
 are average at best\, and some haven't played in months\, maybe years\, an
 d just want to occasionally play again and hang out.\n\nDirections: You ca
 n Google "Volleyball Court in Leonia" and it should come up. Or type 41 Wi
 llow Tree Road\, Leonia\, NJ 07605 into your GPS\, but note that it's not 
 on Willow Tree Road\, just near it. Instead\, turn onto Overpeck County Pk
  Driveway off Fort Lee Road (Degraw Avenue). It is past the tennis courts 
 and near a basketball court and track. You can try Googling "Leonia High S
 chool" as well. That should help you find it. You can go to the back high 
 school parking lot and then cross over the train tracks.\n\nPlease note. W
 e don't have the court reserved. If it happens to be taken\, we may play w
 ith those already occupying it\, wait up to a half hour for the existing g
 ame to end\, or try to relocate on the fly. It's certainly possible that w
 e may have to cancel that day if we can't find a suitable spot. And if it'
 s looking like it'll rain or snow\, I'll make a call on whether to cancel 
 around an hour ahead of the scheduled start time.\n\nPlease bring a ball a
 nd net if you have them for possible use during the game. Feel free to bri
 ng a speaker for music\, or snacks and drinks for consumption during play.
 \n\nIf you have trouble finding the court or group\, you can call or text 
 Andy Milone at 201-234-9609. There is plenty of parking and an open bathro
 om at the park.\n\nHope you'll join us for our 22nd casual volleyball even
 t. Questions or comments? You can message Andy on Meetup\, or call/text hi
 m at 201-234-9609. Check out bowling\, soccer\, volleyball\, tennis or one
  of our other activities at: www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-vo
 lleyball\n\nIf interested in staying touch with group members or conversin
 g about future events\, feel free to inquire about our WhatsApp group chat
 .
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/316606290/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260918T023550Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260918T023550Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
